1
00:00:13,600 --> 00:00:20,600
Winter, 1987. The last manual exchange in the county.

2
00:00:46,000 --> 00:00:51,423
Coal yard. …He's out on a run. I'll put you through to dispatch.

3
00:00:56,000 --> 00:00:58,500
Hospital. One moment.

4
00:01:00,000 --> 00:01:03,962
Three-four-seven. …Yes. This is the exchange.

5
00:01:04,500 --> 00:01:08,000
Which factory does your father work at?

6
00:01:07,500 --> 00:01:10,000
The brickworks.

7
00:01:10,000 --> 00:01:12,654
All right. I'll connect you.

8
00:01:25,000 --> 00:01:30,808
Eight tomorrow morning. Cut-over. This whole district goes automatic.

9
00:01:31,000 --> 00:01:33,500
And the board?

10
00:01:33,500 --> 00:01:36,000
Pulled out.

11
00:01:36,000 --> 00:01:38,500
And me?

12
00:01:38,500 --> 00:01:42,308
You go to the counter. Sit. Take the money.

13
00:02:17,800 --> 00:02:20,454
Hello… is that the exchange?

14
00:02:21,000 --> 00:02:23,500
Where to?

15
00:02:23,000 --> 00:02:25,962
It's Jianguo. I'm… on the train.

16
00:02:27,000 --> 00:02:33,500
My mother's alone at home. Tell her I can't make it tonight. Tell her not to wait supper.

17
00:02:33,200 --> 00:02:35,700
All right.

18
00:02:36,000 --> 00:02:38,500
Hello? Exchange?

19
00:02:39,000 --> 00:02:43,269
The line's gone. Your district went over tonight.

20
00:02:44,000 --> 00:02:46,500
Then… could you…

21
00:02:48,000 --> 00:02:50,500
I'll take it to her.

22
00:02:52,600 --> 00:03:00,000
The new cable is already up.

23
00:03:04,600 --> 00:03:11,600
Nobody has to ask for anything any more.

24
00:03:25,000 --> 00:03:29,423
Auntie. It's the exchange. Your Jianguo telephoned.

25
00:03:31,000 --> 00:03:36,192
He said he can't make it tonight. He said not to wait supper.

26
00:03:41,000 --> 00:03:43,500
…Has he eaten?

27
00:03:46,000 --> 00:03:48,500
He said not to wait.

28
00:03:51,000 --> 00:03:53,500
Come in and warm up.

29
00:03:55,000 --> 00:03:57,808
I can't. I'm not off duty yet.

30
00:03:59,000 --> 00:04:03,192
And that thing in your hand… does it still work?

31
00:04:03,200 --> 00:04:05,700
…No.

32
00:04:27,000 --> 00:04:29,500
Hello. Exchange.

33
00:04:36,000 --> 00:04:43,000
A dial tone.
